ARCH TAM NUT

Build this development bootstrap with makepkg --check. Its source commits are
pinned in PKGBUILD. The package contains the static bundle tool, welcome and
hardware inspection command, console aliases, Arch profile, polkit actions,
boot unit and Pacman hooks.

The real tam-start entry finishes the prepared system/settings protocol. The
fixed polkit helper accepts exactly its 32-digit transaction id and applies
that authorized prepared transaction. Native removal checks preserve required
providers. The post-transaction check reports retained runtime
incompatibilities.

Installing this package conflicts with the existing native adapter.
Replacement, dormant-slot conversion, console activation and recorded delivery
integration require the migration procedure and its approvals. Building this
package installs nothing on the host.
